Narrow per-field edit on a KG node. Atomic. Reversible via the
kg_revision_log entry.

Allowed scalar fields:
  category, description, original_sentence, valid_during,
  start_date, end_date, start_date_prose, end_date_prose,
  start_date_confidence, end_date_confidence, importance,
  goal_status, semantic_label.

Allowed list fields (use list_op = add | remove | set):
  aliases, hash_tags.

For label changes use kg_rename_label; for merging use kg_merge_nodes.
Always pass a non-empty `reason`. Pass `dry_run: true` to preview.
